  "goodToKnow": "Dumm means stupid. It's stronger than doof and can sting when aimed at a person. It also describes annoying situations: Das ist dumm gelaufen (That went badly). Dumme Fragen gibt es nicht means there are no stupid questions. Sich dumm stellen is to play dumb, and Dummheit means stupidity. The comparative has an umlaut: dümmer."
